> Parameter-balanced factors and all three source P3D mixtures

For incomingI/outgoingO,the spatial/temporal intermediate width is
floor(27IO/(9I+3O)),at least1. Explicit symmetric kernel/2 borders on both
sides preserve the source stride2phase,which differs from asymmetric SAME.
R(2+1)D inserts normalized spatial and temporal factors;P3D cycles released
A/B/C bottleneck mixtures. With callbacks already including their intended
normalization/activation,A=T(S(x)),B=ReLU(S(x)+T(x)),and source released
C=ReLU(.5*(S(x)+T(S(x)))). The .5coefficient is explicit.

The declared signed affine callbacks below isolate routing and adjoints;
they are explanatory fixtures,not learned video models. Native literal-host
convolution/topology checks cover all530factor/kernel/input derivatives.
```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/factorized_video_routing.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  namespace m = n::models;
  auto x = n::tensor({-2., -1., 0., 1., 2.});
  x.requires_grad_(true);
  std::vector<n::Tensor> output, gradients;
  std::print("| source mixture | outputs | every input adjoint |\n|---|---|---|\n");
  for (int kind = 0; kind < 3; ++kind) {
    const auto y = m::P3dMix(
        x,
        [](const auto &v) {
          return v * 2. - 1.;
        },
        [](const auto &v) {
          return v * 3. + .5;
        },
        static_cast<m::P3dKind>(kind));
    const auto g = n::grad(n::sum(y), {x})[0];
    output.push_back(y);
    gradients.push_back(g);
    std::print("| {} | {} | {} |\n",
               kind == 0   ? "A serial"
               : kind == 1 ? "B parallel"
                           : "C averaged shortcut",
               y, g);
  }
  std::print("Parameter-balanced widths64->128:{},4->8:{}.\n", m::FactorMidplanes(64, 128),
             m::FactorMidplanes(4, 8));
  auto a = dm::graphics::RPlot::create(), b = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
  const std::array<dm::graphics::RGB, 3> colors = {
      {{37, 99, 235}, {220, 38, 38}, {147, 51, 234}}};
  for (int kind = 0; kind < 3; ++kind) {
    const std::string label = kind == 0 ? "A" : kind == 1 ? "B" : "C";
    a.lines(x.to_vector<double>(), output[kind].to_vector<double>(), label, colors[kind]);
    b.lines(x.to_vector<double>(), gradients[kind].to_vector<double>(), label, colors[kind]);
  }
  a.title("Declared P3D routing fixture")
      .x_label("signed scalar input")
      .y_label("actual callback mixture output");
  b.title("Every routing fixture input adjoint")
      .x_label("signed scalar input")
      .y_label("derivative of summed output");
  auto layout = dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2);
  layout.add(a).add(b).size(1100, 500).fit_panels().save_svg(
      "build/factorized_video_routing.svg");
}
```
